    "body": "Summary\r\n\r\nRename package from `bridge_interface` to `robot_gateway` and add pose/waypoint management, route management, and SLAM control APIs.\r\n\r\n**Key changes:**\r\n- **Package rename**: `bridge_interface` → `robot_gateway` with updated configs, launch files, and Docker setup\r\n- **Pose collection API**: New adapter/router for CRUD operations on named poses/waypoints (create, capture current, list, update, delete) backed by `waypoint_manager_interfaces` services\r\n- **Route API**: New adapter/router for route management\r\n- **SLAM control API**: Separated SLAM routes from map routes with activate/delete endpoints\r\n- **Adapter pattern refactor**: Replaced monolithic adapter with separate adapters (`PoseAdapter`, `MapAdapter`, `NavigationAdapter`, `SlamAdapter`, `RouteAdapter`, `StatusAdapter`) behind a base class\r\n- **Misc**: Added /joy publisher, exception handling improvements, CORS config as parameter, updated tests and Dockerfile",
    "created_at": "2026-04-07T08:25:13Z",
